{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/GIF_20250421103914625.gif?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When you opened the coffin, a living person walked out. &quot;It&quot; claims to be from the 21st century, sent back with future tech to save this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/5.gif?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/cb6c0c41f4de47d1bd95813d3b2590ea.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demon-possessed orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A noblewoman who adopts the orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the nation's general, navigating political intrigue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving among the powerful, you'll slowly uncover the dark secrets behind this brutal country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for gameplay, besides <strong>exploration and puzzle-solving</strong>, I\u2019ve incorporated <strong>somg TRPG dice mechanics</strong>. You can freely <strong>save-load</strong>, pick some <strong>hellish choices</strong>\u00a0to extort NPCs, and fully embrace the role of a <strong>chaotic player</strong> in this dice-rolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ee050b848747d4a3b52719726fec1dac.png?t=1747545020\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1747545020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1747545020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/96c1152f4dc67db40ddbd92835329a76b065f144/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747545020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/96c1152f4dc67db40ddbd92835329a76b065f144/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747545020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/GIF_20250421103914625.gif?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When you opened the coffin, a living person walked out. &quot;It&quot; claims to be from the 21st century, sent back with future tech to save this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/5.gif?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/cb6c0c41f4de47d1bd95813d3b2590ea.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demon-possessed orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A noblewoman who adopts the orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the nation's general, navigating political intrigue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving among the powerful, you'll slowly uncover the dark secrets behind this brutal country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1747545020\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for gameplay, besides <strong>exploration and puzzle-solving</strong>, I\u2019ve incorporated <strong>somg TRPG dice mechanics</strong>. You can freely <strong>save-load</strong>, pick some <strong>hellish choices</strong>\u00a0to extort NPCs, and fully embrace the role of a <strong>chaotic player</strong> in this dice-rolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ee050b848747d4a3b52719726fec1dac.png?t=1747545020\" /></p>","developers":["Langgo"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/f64195d4339c78d922a194e392e2d30855394eeb/header.jpg?t=1747545020","is_free":false